<h1>Deshaun Watson's Preseason Return: <em>The Comeback From Two Torn Achilles</em></h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 7 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>🏥 Preseason 2026 · Browns</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">Deshaun Watson outplayed Shedeur Sanders in Cleveland's preseason opener Saturday, his first game action since October 2024. Getting back on the field at all is the real headline — Watson has now come back from two separate Achilles tears in as many years. Here's what that recovery says, and how the Browns' quarterback competition is shaping up.</p>
</div><div class="content">
